BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Haunt on Eden
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261002
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261108
DTSTAMP:20261003T150235Z
UID:3873394b3cfc6441b811f09b8d57@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Haunt on Eden was born from one simple passion: creating unfor
 gettable scares. If Halloween is your favorite time of year because of the
  blood\, screams\, and heart-pounding terror\, then you've found your kind
  of place. What began in 2013 as a modest 20' x 30' backyard haunt at the 
 home of Jeff and Susan Donis has grown into one of Connecticut's premier h
 aunted attractions. After five years of expanding far beyond what their ba
 ckyard could hold\, Haunt on Eden found its permanent home at Mount Southi
 ngton Ski Area\, where it has thrilled guests every fall since 2018.\n\nSo
 urce: https://ctvisit.com/events/haunt-eden-1
LOCATION:Mount Southington Ski Area\, 396 Mount Vernon Rd.\, Plantsville C
 T\, 06479
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/haunt-eden-1
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mystic Pizza
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261002
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTSTAMP:20261003T150235Z
UID:2f370c160e1fa2e02395b812feaa@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:A new musical you'll love at first slice! Based on the beloved
  1988 MGM rom-com that launched the career of Julia Roberts\, MYSTIC PIZZA
  is a new musical about three working-class girls who navigate the complex
 ities of life\, love\, and family in a small-town pizza joint serving ever
 yone from the townies to the privileged country club set. And what's in th
 at secret sauce\, you ask?The hits of the 80s and 90s! The hit songs range
  from "Girls Just Want to Have Fun" to "Hold On" to "Nothing's Gonna Stop 
 Us Now." This show is recommended for ages 12 and up.\n\nSource: https://c
 tvisit.com/events/mystic-pizza
LOCATION:Palace Theater\, 100 East Main Street\, 100 East Main Street\, Wa
 terbury CT\, 06702
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/mystic-pizza
END:VEVENT
