 ’s portrayal of Freeman is told from an emotional and exciting first-per
 son perspective that vividly illustrates the struggle of African Americans
  during the Revolutionary War.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/jorda
 n-freeman-and-revolutionary-war
